SUMMARY:UPPER A (push-emphasis) — bench/press + a row. No leg cost\, won'
 t touch tomorrow's test.
DESCRIPTION:Week 3 of 17 - Base\nRECOVERY WEEK. Upper/Lower split: two up
 per sessions (Tue\, Fri) so chest and back get 2x frequency at zero cost
  to running\; one lower session (Thu)\, which is all the race can afford
 . Only two sessions actually matter: the talk test on a cool morning\, a
 nd Saturday's descents.\n103 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
