DTSTAMP:20260818T134501Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260729
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260730
SUMMARY:Easy 3 km — Barcelona\, early AM by feel. Heat inflates HR\; igno
 re pace and HR\, run by breath.
DESCRIPTION:Week 4 of 17 - Base\nDOWN WEEK - recover\, do not add volume.
 \nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nBarcelona Tue-Fri\, th
 en festival at Amsterdamse Bos (Fri evening\, Sat\, Sun). Down week — th
 e travel timing is ideal\; nothing here builds fitness. Benchmark deferr
 ed to a cool\, recovered morning (Week 6). The long run folds into Sat f
 estival morning. Festival walking covers the volume\; do not add load.\n
 95 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
