DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260806
SUMMARY:Easy 4-5 km recovery jog — by feel\, conversational\, ignore pace
 /HR. Walk it in if you feel rough.
DESCRIPTION:Week 5 of 17 - Build\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Tal
 k test.\nEASY RE-ENTRY — recovering from the festival weekend. No max ef
 forts\, no heavy legs\, no CP test (moved to Week 6\, now a power test o
 n fresh legs). Optional easy 4 km Thu or rest — your call. Run easy by f
 eel\, hydrate\; only if you feel decent. Getting back to baseline is the
  whole job this week.\n88 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
