DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260809
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260810
SUMMARY:Easy ride 60-90 min — the day after the long run. Zero impact\, H
 R ~130. Aerobic volume without tissue cost.
DESCRIPTION:Week 6 of 17 - Build\nFirst real fitness read of the block — 
 the CP power test\, Tuesday on fresh legs (Mon rest before it). Power\, 
 not HR: after the sensor audit\, power is the channel we trust. This set
 s your real training zones. HR benchmark is shelved until a chest strap.
 \n84 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
