 r) - WED easy run + strides + push - THU vertical + pull - FRI REST - SA
 T LONG DAY. Eccentric work sits 48 h apart throughout: Tue heavy\, Thu m
 oderate\, Sat long. That spacing is the constraint - force loss needs 3 
 days to recover and soreness 4\, so 24 h between eccentric sessions comp
 ounds damage instead of building tolerance. Cutbacks weeks 10 and 13. CU
