  HANGS\, 2-3 x max\, target 90 s by October. Grip takes 4-6 weeks to cha
 nge and it is what limits the farmers carry. About 3 minutes total added
  to the session.
DESCRIPTION:Week 9 of 17 - Build\nGUT TRAINING STARTS. Target 60-80 g car
 b/h by week 14\, from 40-50 now\, +10 g every two weeks. No drop bags an
 d no crew at Madeira - only ~2 checkpoints\, ~10 km apart - so you carry
  400-500 g of carbohydrate yourself. Rehearse the weight and the stowage
 \, not just the products. INTENSITY STARTS THIS WEEK. Thursday's vertica
 l becomes intervals - the plan had no hard sessions at all through weeks
  7-8\, which was a gap. Target distribution is 80-85% easy\, 15-20% hard
 \, with the hard work on incline.\n59 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
