SUMMARY:KIT REHEARSAL: load the vest to ~2.6 kg with full race carbohydra
 te (~13 gels plus pre-measured mix) and walk 60 min. Checkpoints are WAT
 ER ONLY - you carry every calorie across three ~2h10 legs. Drink mix mus
 t stay 6-8%: a 500 ml flask holding 80 g is 16%\, and 42% of a 10% drink
  is still in the stomach an hour later.
DESCRIPTION:Week 9 of 17 - Build\nGUT TRAINING STARTS. Target 60-80 g car
 b/h by week 14\, from 40-50 now\, +10 g every two weeks. No drop bags an
 d no crew at Madeira - only ~2 checkpoints\, ~10 km apart - so you carry
  400-500 g of carbohydrate yourself. Rehearse the weight and the stowage
