UID:ultraxmadeira25k-w10-s4-vertical@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260818T134501Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260910
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260911
SUMMARY:VERTICAL 40 min - STAIRWELL\, your own building or a car park. ~1
 1 x 15 floors\, about 495 m. Lift up\, WALK DOWN - the descent is the po
 int. Dutch stair pitch is 30-33 deg\, inside the optimal climbing range\
 , and Madeira is full of stone staircases. Zero travel\, weather-proof.
DESCRIPTION:Week 10 of 17 - Build\nDOWN WEEK - recover\, do not add volum
 e.\nCutback. Deliberate\, and the reason matters: in trail runners\, inj
 ury weeks were preceded by load DROPPING 16-24% then rebounding 15-37%. 
 Yo-yo loading\, not absolute load\, is what precedes injury. This dip is
  planned and the rebound is controlled.\n52 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
