SUMMARY:OPTIONAL easy ride 60-75 min - the day after the long day. Zero i
 mpact. THIS IS THE FIRST THING TO CUT when work bites.
DESCRIPTION:Week 15 of 17 - Peak\nPEAK WEEKEND - Sat 17 Oct\, 15 days out
 . This is the overload the taper is built on\; the evidence favours peak
 ing 14-15 days out\, not five weeks. 3:45-4:00 and 1\,600-1\,800 m: roug
 hly 60-70% of race duration but 80-90% of race vertical. Vertical specif
 icity is the lever\, not duration.\n21 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
