 e you count the fall risk. And it will never feel hard - VO2 on descents
  is only 79% of threshold versus 100% uphill\, so your breathing will te
 ll you nothing. That is the trap. Short steps\, 185-195 spm\, gaze 4-5 m
  ahead on the second upcoming foothold\, walk the stone staircases\, zig
