 ad 8-10 g/kg for 36-48 h = 450-560 g. Caffeine ~100 mg at 3 h and 75-100
  mg at 4.5 h\, 150-200 mg total - do not scale from 70 kg examples. WEAT
 HER: use Santana on the north coast\, not Funchal - 18 C max\, 110 mm of
  rain across ~40% of days. Wet basalt and hypothermia are the risks here
 \, not heat. Bib pickup Fri 30 Oct or Sat 31 Oct\, 18:00-20:00\, Machico
  Forum. No crew\, no pacers\, no drop bags.\n4 days to Ultra X Madeira 2
 5K.
