DTSTAMP:20260818T134502Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261213
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261214
SUMMARY:Long easy run 14 km
DESCRIPTION:Week 5 of 10 - Build\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Tal
 k test.\nPriority order from 182k measured doubles teams: running (r=0.9
 0 with finish) > roxzone > lunges/burpees/sled pull. Wall balls correlat
 e r=0.266 - the LOWEST of any segment in doubles. Do not spend training 
 on them. Cold immersions start this week and run through February - 5-6 
 short exposures halve the cold-shock response\, which is the mechanism b
 ehind most swim DNFs and 90 of 120 recorded sudden deaths in US triathlo
 n.\n41 days to HYROX Amsterdam Doubles.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
