BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hyroxamsterdamdoubles-w10-s0-easy@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260818T134502Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270117
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270118
SUMMARY:Easy shakeout 5 km
DESCRIPTION:Week 10 of 10 - Race\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Tal
 k test.\nRACE WEEK. Target 88-95 min\, NOT 80-85 - measured doubles stat
 ion totals are 28:23\, not the 25 I first assumed\, so the 80-85 band ac
 tually needs 5:47/km over 8 compromised reps. TACTICS: (1) expect R8 to 
 be your slowest run at every level - it is for everyone\; (2) a controll
 ed 12-15% positive split is optimal\, even pacing is NOT a lever (measur
 ed dR2 = 0.000)\; (3) never let the sled stop - at 56 kg you pay the bre
 akaway cost every restart\; (4) grippy solid-rubber shoes are worth 30-6
 0 s on the sled\; (5) don't chase wall balls\, flex that split to whoeve
 r is holding up.\n6 days to HYROX Amsterdam Doubles.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
