 CTICS: (1) expect R8 to be your slowest run at every level - it is for e
 veryone\; (2) a controlled 12-15% positive split is optimal\, even pacin
 g is NOT a lever (measured dR2 = 0.000)\; (3) never let the sled stop - 
 at 56 kg you pay the breakaway cost every restart\; (4) grippy solid-rub
 ber shoes are worth 30-60 s on the sled\; (5) don't chase wall balls\, f
 lex that split to whoever is holding up.\n5 days to HYROX Amsterdam Doub
 les.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
