DESCRIPTION:Week 2 of 12 - Base\nFirst brick. Start the run within 5 minu
 tes of racking the bike and expect the first 10 min to feel wrong - it n
 ormalises by km 3 regardless of fitness. Get a bike fit booked: saddle h
 eight and cleat alignment are named ITBS contributors and you are about 
 to add 3 h/week of riding.\n76 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
