DTSTAMP:20260818T134502Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270221
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270222
SUMMARY:Long ride 80 km\, last 20 km at race effort\, fuelling 60 g/h (18
 5 min)
DESCRIPTION:Week 4 of 12 - Build\nGUT TRAINING STARTS - 8-12 weeks out is
  the window. Target 60-70 g carb/h on the bike\, NOT 90: measured exogen
 ous glucose oxidation is 33 g/h under 70 kg vs 45 g/h above it. At 56 kg
  your ceiling is genuinely lower. Fuel every session over 75 min\, +10-1
 5 g/h every 1-2 weeks\, and use the exact race products (Maurten\, Preci
 sion PH 1000).\n62 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
