BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ironman703venicejesolo-w8-s0-cycling@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260818T134502Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270321
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270322
SUMMARY:Long ride 100 km steady at IF 0.70 (225 min)
DESCRIPTION:Week 8 of 12 - Build\nBiggest week. Bike pacing: target IF 0.
 68-0.72\, cap the first 30 min 5 W BELOW target. Above 0.80 on a flat co
 urse is almost always a bike PB and a run blow-up. Also: this is a NON-D
 RAFTING race - 6 bike lengths clear\, pass within 25 s\, 5-minute penalt
 y box. You ride in groups\; this is a skill you do not have.\n34 days to
  IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
