DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270327
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270328
SUMMARY:Long run 18 km easy - THIS IS THE CAP. Athletes whose long run is
  15-21 km average 2:03 for the half\; only 26% run over 21 km in trainin
 g.
DESCRIPTION:Week 8 of 12 - Build\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Tal
 k test.\nBiggest week. Bike pacing: target IF 0.68-0.72\, cap the first 
 30 min 5 W BELOW target. Above 0.80 on a flat course is almost always a 
 bike PB and a run blow-up. Also: this is a NON-DRAFTING race - 6 bike le
 ngths clear\, pass within 25 s\, 5-minute penalty box. You ride in group
 s\; this is a skill you do not have.\n28 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jes
 olo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
