DTSTAMP:20260818T134502Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270328
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270329
SUMMARY:Long ride 110 km - longest of the block (245 min)
DESCRIPTION:Week 9 of 12 - Peak\nOPEN WATER STARTS - the single highest-c
 onsequence item in this plan. 90 of 120 sudden deaths in US triathlon oc
 curred in the swim\, and the mechanism is cold-water panic\, not fitness
 . You should already have done 5-6 cold immersions over the winter\; thi
 s is where it gets applied in a wetsuit.\n27 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice
 -Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
